{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On December 31st, life in a big city changes. The air is filled with anticipation of celebration and miracles, so even going to a disliked job doesn\u2019t feel quite so terrible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a young man named Tom who works as a barista in a shopping mall. His shift falls on December 31st, so he makes coffee and watches as the world sinks into New Year\u2019s hustle and bustle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small story filled with light humor and a heartfelt atmosphere. We hope this visual novel will give you a sense of holiday warmth and remind you that joy can be found in the most unexpected places. Even (sorry) at work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm and cozy visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute soundtrack.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376570/c992e6633ffe60335204b66b962b74ecb813deec.jpg"},{"name":"Bad boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376570/7a9cbfe94d0b4af84aae70c8e38963aa13f3150d.jpg"},{"name":"Test of Strength","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376570/f620c2e27f3b48b55037618333cfa8fe9dab07a2.jpg"},{"name":"New hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376570/dea928f5b03af83dba69ae742587564d508376f5.jpg"},{"name":"Loneliness and the City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376570/781dffb2091531170fa4725fb966759152e5d45e.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3376570?t=1772761804","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3376570?t=17727618